'''Siege Directive''' is a unique [[Technology (Age of Empires IV)|technology]] available to the [[Abbasid Dynasty]] in ''[[Age of Empires IV]]'' that can be researched at the [[House of Wisdom]] (with the [[House of Wisdom#Abbasid Dynasty|Administration Wing]] upgrade) in the [[Castle Age (Age of Empires IV)|Castle Age]]. It grants all siege weapons +25% bonus damage (not general damage), and increases the speed at which infantry can construct them in the field by 50%. 

If [[Preservation of Knowledge]] has been researched, this technology costs -20%.

